        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kabaka Awa Ekiragiro Obutatta Bayudaaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ku lunaku olwo Kabaka Akaswero n'awa Nnabagereka Eseza ebintu byonna",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ebya Kamani omulabe w'Abayudaaya. Eseza n'ategeeza Kabaka nti alina oluganda ku Moluddekaayi, era okuva mu kiseera ekyo Moluddekaayi n'ajjanga mu maaso ga Kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'aggyako empeta ye gye yaggya ku Kamani n'agiwa Moluddekaayi, ate era ne Eseza n'afuula Moluddekaayi okuvunaanyizibwa ebintu ebyali ebya Kamani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Eseza n'agenda ewa Kabaka nate ng'amwegayirira ng'agwa ku bigere bye n'okukaaba nga bw'akaaba, ng'amusaba akomye enteekateeka embi zonna eza Kamani Omwagaagi, n'enkwe ze yali asalidde Abayudaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'agololera Eseza omuggo ogwa zaabu, amangu ago Eseza n'agolokoka n'ayimirira mu maaso ga Kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eseza n'ayogera nti, \"Kabaka bw'anasiima, era obanga ŋŋaanze mu maaso ga Kabaka, nange obanga musanyusa, bawandiike ekiragiro okujjulula ebbaluwa Kamani mutabani wa Kammedasa Omwagaagi, ze yayiiya era n'awandiika okuzikiriza Abayudaaya mu bitundu byonna ebya kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnyinza ntya okugumiikiriza okulaba obulabe obulijja ku bantu bange, era n'okulaba okuzikirizibwa okw'ennyumba yange?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Kabaka Akaswero n'agamba Nnabagereka Eseza ne Moluddekaayi Omuyudaaya nti, \"Olw'okuba Kamani yali ayagala kuzikiriza Abayudaaya, ebintu bye mbiwadde Eseza, era n'okuwanikibwa awanikibbwa ku Kalabba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo muwandiike ekiwandiiko ekirala mu linnya lya Kabaka ku lw'Abayudaaya nga bwe musiima, era mukisseeko akabonero n'empeta ya Kabaka, kubanga tewali kiwandiiko ekiwandiikiddwa mu linnya lya Kabaka era ekiteekeddwako akabonero n'empeta ya Kabaka ekiyinza okujjululwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olw'amakumi abiri mu esatu mu mwezi ogwokusatu, gwe mwezi Sivaani abawandiisi ba Kabaka ne bayitibwa ne bawandiika byonna Moluddekaayi bye yalagira Abayudaaya, ebbaluwa n'eweerezebwa eri abaamasaza, ne bagavana n'abakungu abaafuganga mu bitundu ekikumi mu abiri mu omusanvu (127) okuva e Buyindi okutuusa ku Buwesiyopya. Ebiragiro by'awandiikibwa eri buli ssaza ng'empandiika yaalyo bwe yali, n'eri buli ggwanga ng'olulimi lwabwe bwe lwali, n'eri Abayudaaya mu mpandiika yaabwe era ne mu lulimi lwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moluddekaayi n'awandiika mu linnya lya Kabaka Akaswero, ebbaluwa n'azissaako akabonero n'empeta ya Kabaka, n'aziweereza zitwalibwe ababaka abeebagala embalaasi ezidduka ennyo ate nga zaakuzibwa mu bisibo bya Kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiragiro kya Kabaka ky'awa Abayudaaya mu buli kibuga olukusa okukuŋŋaana n'okwekuuma; okuzikiriza, n'okutta, n'okusaanyaawo eggye lyonna ery'eggwanga lyonna oba essaza lyonna erinaabalumba, abakazi baabwe n'abaana baabwe abato, ate era n'okunyaga ebintu by'abalabe baabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku olwalondebwa Abayudaaya okukola bino mu bitundu byonna ebya Kabaka Akaswero lwe lwali olunaku olw'ekkumi n'essatu mu mwezi ogw'ekkumi n'ebiri, gwe mwezi Adali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyaggyibwa mu kiragiro ekyo byali bya kuba nga tteeka mu buli kitundu, era n'okumanyibwa eri abantu aba buli ggwanga, nti ku lunaku olwo Abayudaaya beeteekereteekere okulwanyisa abalabe baabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ababaka abeebagala embalaasi za Kabaka, ne bagenda mbiro, ku kiragiro kya Kabaka, era n'ekiragiro ekiwandiikiddwa ne kirangirirwa mu lubiri lw'e Susani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayudaaya Bawangula Abalabe Baabwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Moluddekaayi n'ava mu maaso ga Kabaka ng'ayambadde ebyambalo bya Kabaka ebya kaniki n'ebyeru, era ng'atikkiddwa engule ennene eya zaabu, era ng'ayambadde omunagiro ogwa bafuta ennungi n'olugoye olw'effulungu. Ekibuga ekya Susani ne kisanyuka nnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate n'eri Abayudaaya kyali kiseera kya ssanyu, n'okujaguza n'ekitiibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu buli kitundu, ne mu buli kibuga, ekiragiro kya Kabaka we kyatuuka, waaliyo essanyu n'okujaguza n'embaga nnene ddala mu Bayudaaya. Era abantu bangi abamawanga amalala ne bafuuka Abayudaaya olw'entiisa ey'Abayudaaya eyali ebakutte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
